                "text": "60 years ago, Medicare and Medicaid were established to guarantee every American access to quality, affordable health care. Now, the GOP tax bill could strip health care from 1.5 million New Yorkers, including seniors, children, and veterans  who depend on these vital programs.\n\nI am committed to continuing the fight to protect Medicare and Medicaid for my constituents and the American people.",
